 "description": "<p>Thrusting is what separates this G-spot vibrator from the static kind: the shaft extends and retracts on its own rhythm, doing the motion your wrist would otherwise supply. Ten vibration modes ride on top, from low rumbles up to a high-frequency setting built to finish the job the thrusting starts.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator blue\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblue_3_480x480.jpg?v=1689651252\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></p>\n<p>The combination matters because the G-spot responds to pressure in motion better than to vibration alone. The extending-retracting stroke keeps that pressure changing while the motor underneath adds texture to each cycle — a two-layer sensation from a single shaft.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblue_5_480x480.jpg?v=1689651254\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator blue\"></p>\n<p>The 60 dB ceiling keeps things livable in shared housing, the IPX6 body takes shower sessions and tap-rinse cleaning, and the magnetic USB connection tops the battery without a port to fumble in the dark.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblue_4_480x480.jpg?v=1689651257\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator blue\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Vibration modes: 10, including a high-frequency setting</li>\n<li>Motion: extend-retract thrusting stroke</li>\n<li>Noise: below 60 dB</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX6</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblue_6_480x480.jpg?v=1689651260\" alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator blue\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator blue\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblue_7_480x480.jpg?v=1689651262\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator blue\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorblue_2_480x480.jpg?v=1689651248\"></p>\n<p>Aimed at internal stimulation first — the kind of toy that replaces wrist work entirely.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>G-spot thrusting vibrator with 10 vibration modes, high-frequency finish setting, sub-60 dB motor, USB magnetic charging and IPX6 body.</p>\n",
